# Lantern 12 — RetroOS system font (menus, title bars, buttons, dialogs)
# (C) RetroOS contributors. Original drawing. License: SIL OFL 1.1.
#
# Proportional, bold: 2-pixel stems, 1-pixel horizontals (docs/STYLE.md §4).
# Format: "@ <hex codepoint> <name> [+<first row>] [w<width>]" followed by
# rows of '#' (ink) and '.' (paper); every row of a glyph has the glyph's
# width, which includes one column of spacing on the right. Rows before
# <first row> and after the last given row are blank.
#
# Metrics: cell 13 rows. Cap height rows 1-9, x-height rows 4-9, baseline
# under row 9, descenders rows 10-11, row 12 blank.

